 libssl-dev, libopencv-dev, libfprint-2-tod-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/OWNER/lg-gram-fingerprint-linux
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: lg-gram-fingerprint
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libfprint-2-tod1, fprintd, unzip
Recommends: libpam-fprintd
Description: driver for the Goodix GXFP5A8B fingerprint sensor (LG gram)
 libfprint TOD driver and setup tool for the Goodix GXFP5A8B ("Geneva",
 GF3268 + GM168SEC) SPI fingerprint sensor found in LG gram laptops
 (e.g. 15Z90N). Works with fprintd for login, lock screen and sudo.
 .
 The sensor configuration is extracted from LG's Windows driver with
 lg-gram-fp-tool; no proprietary files are shipped.
